<Base title="The Program — Chamblee Softball" bodyClass="production-site"><SiteHeader /><main><PageHero eyebrow="ABOUT CHAMBLEE SOFTBALL" title="One program. One standard." text="Developing confident athletes, committed teammates, and Bulldogs who lead well beyond the field." image="IMG_6924.jpeg" /><section class="program-intro section-wrap"><div><p>OUR PROGRAM</p><h2>Poise in the circle.<br/>Power at the plate.</h2></div><div><p>Chamblee Softball brings Varsity, Junior Varsity, and Middle School athletes together under one identity. We compete with purpose, develop fundamentals, and build a culture where players learn to trust their preparation and each other.</p><p>The booster club supports that mission through fundraising, volunteers, family communication, field improvements, and community partnerships.</p></div></section><section class="program-panels"><article id="facilities"><span>01</span><h3>Facilities & directions</h3><p>Home games are played on the Chamblee High School campus in Chamblee, Georgia. Parking and arrival details will be posted with each home game.</p><a href="https://maps.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open directions ↗</a></article><article id="history"><span>02</span><h3>History & honors</h3><p>A growing Bulldog tradition shaped by generations of athletes, coaches, families, and region competition.</p><b>Championship and award history coming soon.</b></article><article id="booster"><span>03</span><h3>Booster club</h3><p>The Chamblee Softball Booster Club works alongside coaches to strengthen the experience of every athlete in the program.</p><b>Board member profiles coming soon.</b></article><article id="volunteer"><span>04</span><h3>Volunteer</h3><p>Game-day operations, concessions, photography, fundraising, and special events all depend on family and community support.</p><a href="mailto:softball@example.org">Ask how to help →</a></article></section></main><SiteFooter /></Base>
